      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِبْنٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَبَنٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>A want,</i> or <i>thing
